From a908d67929d9a55cc7776c9bce8e307394652777 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lee_Alderman <tinytim3271@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:01:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Market-readiness fixes: archive policy, usability, legal
 pages, CI signing

- Invoices, payments and records tied to money are archived instead of
  deleted (hidden from lists, kept for tax reports, restorable by an admin
  from Settings -> Archived records); drafts are still deleted.
- Usability: 0 axe violations and no sideways scroll on desktop and phone
  (contrast, 12px text floor, tap targets, dispatch cards, Help overlap,
  phone invoice cards, payroll overlap, pinch zoom allowed).
- Cache-busting: index.html asset versions are content hashes stamped by
  the build.
- Full privacy policy and terms (Alderman Enterprises LLC DBA ShopCrank),
  pricing copy fixes, robots.txt and sitemap.xml.
- CI: actions bumped to Node 24 releases, Windows Authenticode signing from
  secrets, signed Android release build and an emulator launch test, a
  manual Twilio token check workflow, Dependabot config.
- Browser smoke: admin delete/archive/restore, texting through Twilio and
  Stripe subscription checkout against local stand-ins.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GGEY5cQcwh34RQLfpVUQwK
