+        <ul>
+          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, database, file storage, sign-in email delivery, bot protection, and site analytics.</li>
+          <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — subscription billing and card payments.</li>
+          <li><strong>Twilio</strong> — text messages and phone calls.</li>
+          <li><strong>AgentPhone and xAI</strong> — the AI phone assistant and voice features.</li>
+          <li><strong>Google, Anthropic and Deepgram</strong> — AI features such as the assistant, estimate suggestions, transcription and speech. The text, image or audio needed for a request is sent to the provider to produce the response.</li>
+          <li><strong>PostHog</strong> — product analytics and error tracking.</li>
+          <li><strong>Services a shop connects</strong> — for example QuickBooks, PartsTech or AutoZone. Data flows to them only after the shop connects them, under their own terms.</li>
+        </ul>
+        <p>We may also disclose data when the law requires it, to protect the rights and safety of ShopCrank, its customers or others, or as part of a merger or sale of the business, in which case this policy continues to apply.</p>
