+        <h2>Text messaging</h2>
+        <p>Shops use ShopCrank to text their own customers about appointments, estimates, repair status, invoices and payments. Shops are responsible for getting each customer's consent before texting them. Message frequency varies with the customer's service. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop messages from a shop and HELP for help; STOP replies are recorded and honored automatically.</p>
